<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<main class="page page--flush">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <% if (favorites.length) { %>
      <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="marquee-track"><% [...favorites, ...favorites].forEach((f) => { %><img src="<%= f.poster %>" alt="" loading="lazy"><% }) %></div>
      </div>
    <% } %>
    <div class="about-shade"></div>
    <div class="about-title">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> The story</span>
      <h1 class="landing-logo" data-egg="logo">Krav<span>N</span></h1>
      <p class="landing-tag">Where movie theories become discussions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="shell shell--narrow prose">
    <h2>Welcome to KravN</h2>
    <p>Ever finished a movie and immediately thought, <em>“Wait… did anyone else notice that?”</em> Or spent way too much time explaining why your theory is better than the writer's original ending?</p>
    <p>That's exactly why KravN exists — a space built for the moment the credits roll and the real conversation starts. A place for movie lovers, binge-watchers, plot-hole hunters, and people who simply have too many opinions about films and web series.</p>

    <div class="sprocket" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>

    <h2>The story behind KravN</h2>
    <p>Hey! I'm Sahaj Jain, founder of KravN. I'm a Computer Science student who enjoys building things almost as much as watching way too many movies.</p>
    <p>KravN started as a small learning project and somehow turned into my first fully deployed web application. Along the way I picked up databases, authentication, deployment, late-night debugging, and the important lesson that one tiny bug can ruin an otherwise peaceful evening.</p>
    <p>This is only the beginning — more features, better discussions, and a lot more movie debates are on the way. Hope y'all have fun posting movie theories and reviews.</p>

    <div class="contact">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:jainsahaj167@gmail.com"><%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'mail' }) %> jainsahaj167@gmail.com</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.instagram.com/kravn.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@kravn.in <%- include('partials/icon', { n: 'ext' }) %></a>
    
</main>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
